  "comment": "Sumber: https://www.arduino.cc/en/Tutorial/AnalogInOutSerial This example shows you how to read an analog input pin, map the result to a range from 0 to 255, use that result to set the pulse width modulation (PWM) of an output pin to dim or brighten an LED and print the values on the serial monitor of the Arduino Software (IDE). Contents 1 Hardware Required 2 Rangkaian 3 Code 4 Referensi Hardware",
